  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you fail at a Sleight of Hand check targeting a creature by 5 or less, the creature does not notice your attempt directly but rather just gets a vague sense that something odd is going on. It becomes uncertain until the end of its next turn or until you attack it. You cannot use this talent on the same creature again for 8 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/subterfuge#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
